  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3603.05 Dissemination of Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3603.05 Dissemination of Information.\n\n(a) The chief of the law enforcement agency with jurisdiction over a school zone shall receive the information relative to drug activity within a drug-free school zone.\n\n(b) Notification of the drug activity shall be by telephone.\n\nSource. #5382, eff 4-21-92; ss by #6703, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8553, eff 1-26-06; ss by #10591, eff 5-14-14; ss by #14008, eff 6-25-24\n\nAPPENDIX",
